			"notes": "## General\n### This update breaks worlds!\n- Updated to 1.21\n- Introduced a new recipe type - Crucible\n- Started work on the progression/tutorial book\n- Expanded and deepened crafting, lore and features\n- Improved the visuals\n- Improved the APIs\n\n## Detailed\n### Additions\n- Energy veil\n- Grimoire - tutorial book\n- Focus plating\n- Focuses belt\n- Trueseer goggles\n- Crucible and Crucible recipes\n- Mortar and pestle\n- Charge shells\n\n### Changes\n- New crafting recipes for Wands\n- Completely redesigned HUD and settings\n- Added textures for the Lens\n- Added animations for the Charging worktable\n\n### Internal\n- Revamped all Client-side code and APIs\n- Completely redid Focuses API\n- Improved Reports API\n- Removed DataFixers"
		},
